### Helper Functions Already Available
- `chebyshev(a, b)` — Chebyshev distance
- `createLOSBlocker(world)` — returns `(x,y) => boolean` for LOS checks
- `resolveSpellRadius(world, actor, spell)` — base radius + passive bonuses
